<title>UK: Hypo in Essen sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hypo in Essen sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY    18.APR.06</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES    *STEPS UP TO 5.25 PCT IN YEAR THREE, 6.0 PCT IN YEAR</p>
<p>	     FIVE, 7.0 PCT IN YEAR SEVEN AND 10.0 PCT IN YEAR NINE</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 465</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
